          "headline": "The Supreme Court junks Romualdez's petition as auditors flag ₱532 billion at DPWH",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>The Supreme Court on November 4 junked Martin Romualdez's petition against the Ombudsman's plunder investigation as moot, since he has already been arraigned before the Sandiganbayan. State auditors reported 9,061 DPWH projects worth ₱531.79 billion were implemented inefficiently in 2025, with bidders of questionable financial capacity winning thousands of contracts. On November 7 the Ombudsman demanded answers over a personal aide inside Romualdez's cell. The scandal is now an audit problem and a jail-rules problem.</p>",
