          "headline": "Inflation hits 7.8% in October, the fastest in nearly four years",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>Inflation accelerated to 7.8% in October from 7.2% in September, the Philippine Statistics Authority said on November 5, the fastest since February 2023. Transport inflation hit 20.1% as the late-September fare hike fed through, gasoline ran at 51.1% and diesel at 62.4%, and rice at 20.7%. Deutsche Bank lifted its 2026 forecast to 5.9%. Money sent home now buys visibly less.</p>",
