          "headline": "Washington says no Pax Silica deal at the ASEAN Summit",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>US Ambassador Lee Lipton said on November 7 that no Pax Silica announcement was ever planned for the ASEAN Summit in Manila, after the BCDA floated a signing there. Earlier in the week Malacañang promised relocation housing and financial aid to residents and Indigenous peoples displaced by the Tarlac hub, and the Energy department said a nuclear reactor is one option for its 3,000-megawatt load. The terms are still not public.</p>",
